        },
        {
          "label": "Relative discount in percentage",
          "type": "number",
          "help": "The exact amount will be calculated by total price of the programme. The code only applies to base price of the programme (including Registration fee) It does not apply to products."
        },
        {
          "label": "Relative discount limit",
          "type": "number",
          "help": "You can cap the relative discount to a maximum value. If calculated discount will be higher than this value, it will be capped."
        },
